  "readme": "TheSims.css A “Design System” inspired by the 2000 life simulation game, The Sims. View the demo page here: thesimscss.inbn.dev. Installation / usage You can load it directly from unpkg: <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://unpkg.com/thesims.css\"> or install it via npm: npm install thesims.css Acknowledgements The code is adapted from 98.css by Jordan Scales. This library uses ComicNeue as a fallback for devices which do not ship with Comic Sans. The monospace font is Comic Mono by Shannon Miwa and dtinth.",
